      "message": "[warning] Line 26: 🟡 `display(_:)` swaps child controllers with manual `addChild/removeFromParent`, but it does not run a containment transition (`transition(from:to:...)` or explicit `begin/endAppearanceTransition`). When the root container is already visible, this can skip child appearance callbacks (`viewWillAppear/viewDidAppear` and disappearance counterparts), which can break setup/teardown logic in hosted screens. Use `transition(from:to:duration:options:animations:completion:)` (or explicit appearance transition calls) for the swap so lifecycle delivery stays correct.",
